## =====================================================================
## EcoCharge Solution - root .gitignore (monorepo: .NET backend + React client)
## =====================================================================

## ---------- .NET ----------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
*.pdb

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# EF Core migrations are versioned; only ignore local dev SQLite DB files
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
!**/Migrations/**

# Local secrets / environment overrides (never commit real secrets)
**/appsettings.Development.local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

## ---------- Node / React client ----------
node_modules/
EcoCharge.Client/dist/
EcoCharge.Client/dist-ssr/
EcoCharge.Client/.vite/
*.local

# npm/yarn/pnpm logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

## ---------- Docker ----------
docker-compose.override.yml

## ---------- IDE / OS ----------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## ---------- Local-only / never published content ----------
## Nothing related to the AI-assisted workflow, internal French notes, or
## the original prompt/script that kicked off this project should ever be
## pushed publicly. Kept locally only — do not remove these lines.
AGENTS.md
AI-Context/
docs/
*.private.md
